Hardware design files in this directory (schematics, layouts, BOMs, gerbers)
are intended to be released under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
Permissive (CERN-OHL-P-2.0) once real KiCad sources exist.

https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_p_v2.txt

Until then, treat sketches and READMEs as documentation under the same
contribution rules as the rest of the repository.
